<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλοκ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twining round, interlacing</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				540b4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλοκαὶ γυναικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.56.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				39
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλοκῆς δεῖται [ὁ
			κιττός</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.649c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> in the
			philos. of Epicurus, <i>interlacing</i> of atoms, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.8U.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2p.44U.
			</span></i> (pl.), al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλοκὴν περιπλέκεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					208
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., of
			one wrestling in argument, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.199
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>entanglement, complication,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				533.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>intricacy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλοκὰς λόγων</span>
			<i>circumlocutions</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				494
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Meth.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπλοκὰς λίαν ἐρωτᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					74.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί οὖν . . π. λέγεις</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				Strato Com.
				1.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρὶς -πλοκῆς λέγειν τἀληθῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					12.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
